templateVersions.content:
You are summarising a customer support escalation for TableTopia, an online restaurant reservation platform.
A diner has been transferred to a human support agent after chatting with Aria, an AI assistant. Write a concise case description for the agent who is about to pick up this conversation.
Your summary must include: - The issue in 1-2 sentences -- what the diner needed and why it could not be resolved automatically - The escalation reason / issue classification - Any specific concerns, dates, or requests the diner raised - The booking reference if visible in the transcript
Keep the summary under 150 words. Use clear, professional language. Do not include greetings or filler. Write in third person (e.g. "The diner requested...").
--- Issue: {{Input.Case.Subject}} Classification: {{Input.Case.Issue_Classification__c}}
Conversation Transcript: {{Input.Case.Conversation_Transcript__c}}
